# Zoom (the SCREEN settings page, 0.16.1): on, a knob turned fills the main area with its name and value for 1.2 s, on any page; kept (the global record).
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 8
wait 100
expect fxpage 31
expect zoom 0
spin K1 1
wait 100
expect zoom 1
expect zoomknob 0
shot zoom_setting.png
tap FX
wait 1500
expect zoomknob -1
expect view 0
spin K1 3
wait 100
expect zoomknob 0
shot zoom_tempo.png
spin K3 1
wait 100
expect zoomknob 2
wait 1500
expect zoomknob -1
wait 3000
reboot
wait 6500
expect zoom 1
